      "message": "Thanks.  I don\u0027t think things are clear yet, though.  For system_ce, misc_ce, and vendor_ce, this function returns true even for directory that contains the per-user encrypted directories.  That parent directory, such as `/data/system_ce`, is not encrypted itself.\n\nIs it possible to write a one-line summary that accurately describes what this function actually does?  If not, I fear that it\u0027s not clearly defined enough.",
